   "texto": [
    "**Îi trimit bunicii o fotografie** means «I'm sending a picture to Grandma.». **Îi** goes before the verb and **bunicii** identifies who. In plural: **Le scriu bunicilor** («I write to the grandparents.»)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Comparison with Spanish",
   "texto": [
    "The replication of the recipient is normal in Romanian: **îi** plus **bunicii**, as «le» plus «to Grandma» in Spanish. The name changes form: **bunică → bunicii**; in plural, **bunicii → bunicilor**."
   ]
